{"id": "620a6c02-a163-4e45-bb0a-3d3ae8ea9c6c", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "I'll check CloudTrail's actual data event coverage for those four resources in us-east-1.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "tooluse_xJg1vFf4KyO1xVkMrnPZYv", "tool_name": "gather_context", "input": {"prompt": "{
  "task": "Determine whether AWS CloudTrail is actually capturing data events today for four specific resources in us-east-1, account 012345678901_1.",
